msgstr "Aṣàyàn èdè Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-switcher-widget.php:31
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-switcher.php:138
msgid "Let visitors read this page in another language."
msgstr "Jẹ́ kí àwọn alábẹ̀wò ka ojú-ewé yìí ní èdè mìíràn."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-switcher-widget.php:79
